  "totalBlocks": 40,
  "translatedBlocks": 40,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64b3f4664e4c24fc",
      "translationZh": "NInfer 在 Qwen 上表现惊艳，但在实际使用中还有不足。由于 issue/PR 的采纳情况并不太符合我的需求，我创建了一个 fork，并在这周同时开了 3 个 claude code 会话猛攻它，直到它不再出问题。希望你们喜欢。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81248b1774252fea",
      "translationZh": "NVFP4 KV 缓存（从零实现）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b52964d642ce9e9f",
      "translationZh": "我从零为 QIn3.8-27B 实现了一个 4 位 KV 缓存。此后，上游也加入了自己的 NVFP4 实现路径，但我们的方案在架构上有所不同：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a310c8c28927594",
      "translationZh": "自定义 MMA 内核（mma_nvfp4_e4m3，m16n8k64），在 QK 矩阵乘法中使用硬件支持的 E4M3 分块缩放因子。Q 和 K 均被量化为 NVFP4；V 则通过专用解码内核反量化为 BF16，用于 PV 矩阵乘法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb2f43ef40bed697",
      "translationZh": "在量化前对 K（以及 Q）应用 Hadamard 旋转以抑制离群值，而 V 不进行旋转。上游则使用 fp16 存储 V——没有离群值抑制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b87b29773d3f25c6",
      "translationZh": "融合追加：解码内核在生成过程中将当前 K/V 原地量化为 NVFP4——无需单独执行量化步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33b44abd92c57998",
      "translationZh": "自定义缩放因子布局：KV 缩放因子采用自然的行主序布局（而不是权重 MMA 所用的 M128x4 混排布局），因为 KV 的访问模式与权重的访问模式不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9aed1583e413707",
      "translationZh": "结果：每 token、每 KV 头占用 144 字节（int8 为 264，bf16 为 512）——显存占用减少 45%，且没有质量损失（LongBench 45%，与 int8 持平；AIME 96.7%；大海捞针测试 100%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d89b7d424ecbe793",
      "translationZh": "YaRN 上下文扩展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eeef4c18785f41e6",
      "translationZh": "QIn3.8-27B 的 RoPE 配置（theta=1e7，25% 的旋转维度，48/64 个 GDN 层不使用 RoPE）使得线性缩放已足够——无需完整的 NTK-by-parts。我在一张 5090 上将原生的 262k 扩展到 555k（c=3+vision）或 600k（c=1）。已在 600k 下验证质量：LongBench 与 int8 基线相当，592k-token 输出连贯。此外，还推算了在 96GB+ GPU 上实现 8M token 上下文的可能性（尚未测试，我只有一张 5090）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "113d18ef845e3978",
      "translationZh": "带有 host-KV 安全网的多级前缀复用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edd7f43bcd7cf140",
      "translationZh": "上游实现了一个受预算约束的 HostKvProvider，采用 LRU 暂存/恢复机制。我将其替换为一个有实质性差异的系统：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e23324fb1c50f3f2",
      "translationZh": "HostKVSafetyNet：使用锁页主机内存池，支持分散-聚集式多区段分配、内存池紧凑整理，以及用于安全并发恢复的 pin/take 协议。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b3fc08cfdd2ee334",
      "translationZh": "两级前缀匹配：先匹配完整执行前沿，再回退到重写检查点。每个条目都携带一个 ResidentPrefixIdentity（逐 token 的类型/位置/视觉元数据）、用于候选初筛的滚动 FNV 摘要，以及用于保持思考模式一致性的 compact_prefix（去除推理内容后的 token 前缀）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bdf1b23780d8eb94",
      "translationZh": "会话键回退：当前缀匹配失败时（例如 Claude Code 在轮次之间丢弃推理内容），会话键回退机制根据对话身份而非 token 内容进行匹配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7db8a4843cef04e8",
      "translationZh": "在每条释放路径上都先溢出保存、再驱逐：压力规划器驱逐、正常续接释放、start_sequence 槽位接管，以及 fail-all 清理，全部都经过安全网。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8e4f533a5ac9fdf",
      "translationZh": "Token 稳定性：当 preserve_thinking=off 时，所有助手消息中的推理内容都会被移除，从而使提示词的 token 流在各轮之间保持稳定。检查点捕获以轮次边界为锚点，而非执行前沿。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bce94add8ce2e457",
      "translationZh": "已在 3 个并发的 330k-470k 会话中，通过 260+ 次请求验证——缓存轮次无需重新预填充，H2D 恢复耗时约 0.4s，D2H 换出速度为 67K 页/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "98249a7bd01daad8",
      "translationZh": "性能（3 个并发会话，400k+ 上下文，5090@450W）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fe1b80055cff442",
      "translationZh": "117 tok/s（MTP 4.62 tok/轮，接受率 92%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d97bd12177b52a08",
      "translationZh": "2-16s（已缓存 414k，增量 1-14k）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1664002762dc529",
      "translationZh": "260s（414k tokens，速度为 1600 tok/s）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e42f3f0f3fb600e",
      "translationZh": "30 GB（利用率 96%，已管理 181 次驱逐）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e89abce87f304f73",
      "translationZh": "--tolerant-tool-calls：当模型输出格式错误的包装/后缀 token 时，恢复完整的 Qwen 调用，而不是丢弃该调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f38fb1305e4269c",
      "translationZh": "深度匹配式闭合扫描：处理参数值中成对或嵌套的标记，避免朴素解析器因此失效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72f3c6800a4187d1",
      "translationZh": "Responses API 接受工具调用之后的文本/推理内容（上游拒绝这种顺序）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "071c9d7498fc3b28",
      "translationZh": "Froggeric v22 模板：C++ 渲染器，采用 no-dangling-intent 规则、XML think 标签以及正确的函数标签定界符。还做了一些进一步修改以提高可靠性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a3c6e038b1dbd33",
      "translationZh": "动态加载聊天模板（ --chat-template ）——支持任意 .ninfer 镜像，无需对制品打补丁",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a56804018bd89ce0",
      "translationZh": "显式覆盖权重配置（ --weights-profile ）——支持 Ostfralla、QUASAR 及其他转换器布局，并自动检测每层的张量格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f26ae89f7fad24b",
      "translationZh": "OOM 恢复：捕获 std::bad_alloc，清除状态，保留待处理请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "61cc46f385a78b2b",
      "translationZh": "流同步修复：在预填充阶段重置工作区之前同步 CUDA 流（防止释放后使用）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e32aab4bb21115da",
      "translationZh": "请求日志轮转（ --request-log-max-mib、--request-log-keep ），以限制磁盘使用量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
